# =============================================================================
# REMOTE-OPS configuration — LOCAL machine only, NEVER uploaded to cPanel.
# =============================================================================
# Purpose: lets you run SAFE Prisma operations against the remote cPanel
# MySQL database from your LOCAL machine (see scripts/remote-prisma.js):
#
#   npm run prisma:remote:deploy   # prisma migrate deploy (apply pending migrations)
#   npm run prisma:remote:status  # prisma migrate status (list applied/pending)
#   npm run prisma:remote:seed    # idempotent seed (skips when data exists)
#
# The Prisma CLI is NEVER executed on the cPanel server (CloudLinux LVE caps
# virtual memory at ~4GB and the CLI's Wasm schema validation OOMs there).
#
# 1. Copy this file:  cp .env.cpanel.example .env.cpanel
# 2. Fill in values from cPanel > Databases > MySQL Databases
#    (the DB you created for the app — same credentials the Node app uses).
# 3. .env.cpanel is git-ignored. NEVER commit or upload it.
# 4. REMOTE MySQL ACCESS must be enabled for YOUR LOCAL IP:
#    cPanel > MySQL Databases > Remote MySQL > add your public IP
#    (or use the host's provided DB hostname if remote access is blocked).
#
# For first-boot (fresh empty DB) you may also set the initial admin seed
# values here — prisma/seed.js reads ADMIN_EMAIL/ADMIN_PASSWORD.
# =============================================================================

# --- Remote cPanel MySQL/MariaDB connection (from MySQL Databases) ----------
DB_HOST=your-cpanel-db-host.example.com
DB_PORT=3306
DB_USER=cpaneluser_tcg
DB_PASS=your_db_password
DB_NAME=cpaneluser_tcgdb

# --- Pool (small — shared hosting; keep in sync with server env) ------------
DB_POOL_LIMIT=5
DB_POOL_TIMEOUT=10

# --- SSL: enable ONLY if your host enforces TLS on remote MySQL connections --
# disable | require
DATABASE_SSL_MODE=disable

# --- Initial admin (used only when seeding a FRESH empty database) ----------
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@yourdomain.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=ChangeThisStrongPassword123!
